# The same trigger when the human's own Stone Rain destroys the Plains: the
# cause is not an opponent's, so the land stays in the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 10 R
tapformana human 11 R
tapformana human 12 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 2
castspell human 13
resolvestack
